    <main id="top">

        <section class="hero" id="heroSlider">
            <div class="hero-slides">
                <div class="hero-slide is-active" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1653280662710-1cac52cde6d7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=75')"></div>
                <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1644221150186-5d785a471f44?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=75')"></div>
                <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1777919393730-463e2c0b7f4c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=75')"></div>
                <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1640101086894-7d70c3e70179?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=75')"></div>
                <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541888946425-d81bb19240f5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=75')"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-scrim"></div>
            <button class="hero-arrow prev" aria-label="Previous photo">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M15 6L9 12L15 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
            </button>
            <button class="hero-arrow next" aria-label="Next photo">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="hero-dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Hero photo selector">
                <button class="hero-dot is-active" aria-label="Slide 1"></button>
                <button class="hero-dot" aria-label="Slide 2"></button>
                <button class="hero-dot" aria-label="Slide 3"></button>
                <button class="hero-dot" aria-label="Slide 4"></button>
                <button class="hero-dot" aria-label="Slide 5"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-content">
                <div class="wrap">
                    <div class="kicker hero-kicker-a"><span class="dash"></span> Ahmedabad, Gujarat &nbsp;·&nbsp; Est. site &amp; RCC contracting</div>
                    <h1 class="hero-head hero-head-a">From foundation to handover, we build it right.</h1>
                    <p class="hero-copy hero-copy-a">Gajnarayan Laxmi Construction plans, builds and finishes residential, commercial and industrial projects across Ahmedabad — with our own site supervisors and labour teams, so one contractor stays responsible from the first survey to the last coat of paint.</p>
                    <div class="hero-actions hero-actions-a">
                        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-solid">Get a site estimate</a>
                        <a href="#gallery" class="btn btn-ghost">See our sites</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="stats" id="statsSection">
            <div class="wrap stats-grid reveal-stagger reveal">
                <div class="stat"><div class="num">120+</div><div class="label">projects handed over</div></div>
                <div class="stat"><div class="num">18</div><div class="label">years on active sites</div></div>
                <div class="stat"><div class="num">6</div><div class="label">in-house site teams</div></div>
                <div class="stat"><div class="num">100%</div><div class="label">approvals handled in-house</div></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section id="services">
            <div class="wrap">
                <div class="section-head reveal">
                    <h2>Every stage of a build, under one contract</h2>
                    <p class="tag">Residential, commercial and industrial work — plus the design and finishing work that usually needs separate contractors.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="services-grid reveal-stagger reveal">
                    <div class="service">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none"><path d="M6 22L20 10L34 22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /><path d="M10 20V32H30V20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /><rect x="17" y="24" width="6" height="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" /></svg>
                        <h3>Residential construction</h3>
                        <p>Independent bungalows, row houses and apartment blocks, built to the layout you've approved with the municipal authority.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="service">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none"><rect x="8" y="10" width="10" height="22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" /><rect x="22" y="16" width="10" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" /><line x1="11" y1="15" x2="15" y2="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" /><line x1="11" y1="20" x2="15" y2="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" /><line x1="11" y1="25" x2="15" y2="25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" /></svg>
                        <h3>Commercial &amp; industrial</h3>
                        <p>Showrooms, office floors, warehouses and factory sheds — structural work sized for the load and traffic you expect.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="service">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none"><rect x="7" y="9" width="26" height="22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" /><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="33" y2="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="16" y2="31" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /></svg>
                        <h3>Interior fit-out</h3>
                        <p>False ceiling, flooring, modular kitchens and turnkey interiors — scheduled alongside the civil work, not after it.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="service">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none"><path d="M9 30H31" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /><path d="M12 30V16L20 9L28 16V30" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /><path d="M15 30V22H25V30" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" /></svg>
                        <h3>Renovation &amp; repair</h3>
                        <p>Structural extensions, waterproofing and retrofitting for buildings that need work without a full rebuild.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="service">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none"><line x1="8" y1="32" x2="32" y2="32" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /><rect x="17" y="12" width="6" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" /><line x1="10" y1="32" x2="10" y2="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" /><line x1="30" y1="32" x2="30" y2="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" /><line x1="10" y1="20" x2="30" y2="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" /></svg>
                        <h3>Civil &amp; site contracting</h3>
                        <p>RCC framework, boundary walls, roads and site development for plots that need groundwork before anything else.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="service">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none"><rect x="8" y="8" width="24" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" /><line x1="8" y1="16" x2="32" y2="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /><line x1="16" y1="16" x2="16" y2="32" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="3.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" /></svg>
                        <h3>Design &amp; consultation</h3>
                        <p>Layout planning, cost estimation and help getting your plan approved, before a single brick is laid.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="process" id="process">
            <div class="wrap">
                <div class="section-head reveal">
                    <h2>How a project moves through our site</h2>
                    <p class="tag">The same four stages for a single flat renovation or a full commercial shell.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="process-list reveal-stagger reveal">
                    <div class="process-item">
                        <span class="process-num">01</span>
                        <h3>Site visit &amp; consultation</h3>
                        <p>We walk the plot, hear the brief, and give you a realistic first estimate on cost and timeline.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-item">
                        <span class="process-num">02</span>
                        <h3>Design, estimate &amp; approval</h3>
                        <p>Layout, structural drawing and municipal approval paperwork, handled before mobilisation.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-item">
                        <span class="process-num">03</span>
                        <h3>Construction &amp; supervision</h3>
                        <p>A dedicated site supervisor tracks material, labour and quality against the approved drawing.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-item">
                        <span class="process-num">04</span>
                        <h3>Finishing &amp; handover</h3>
                        <p>Snag list closed out, documentation handed over, and a walkthrough before you take possession.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="gallery" id="gallery">
            <div class="wrap">
                <div class="section-head reveal">
                    <h2>Our sites, mid-build</h2>
                    <p class="tag">A running look at active and recently finished sites — swap these for your own project photos.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="gallery-slider reveal" id="siteGallery">
                    <div class="gallery-track">
                        <div class="gallery-slide">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1653280662710-1cac52cde6d7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=75" alt="Site crew working together on a mid-rise structure">
                            <div class="gallery-caption"><h4>Structural crew on site</h4><span>Framework &amp; RCC stage</span></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="gallery-slide">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1777919393730-463e2c0b7f4c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=75" alt="Concrete structure being built with scaffolding">
                            <div class="gallery-caption"><h4>Concrete &amp; scaffolding</h4><span>Shell construction</span></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="gallery-slide">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1640101086894-7d70c3e70179?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=75" alt="Workers preparing rebar at an excavation site">
                            <div class="gallery-caption"><h4>Foundation &amp; rebar</h4><span>Excavation stage</span></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="gallery-slide">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541888946425-d81bb19240f5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=75" alt="Construction crew standing together on site">
                            <div class="gallery-caption"><h4>Site coordination</h4><span>Daily crew briefing</span></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="gallery-slide">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1644221150186-5d785a471f44?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=75" alt="Large building under construction next to a crane">
                            <div class="gallery-caption"><h4>Structure &amp; crane work</h4><span>High-rise progress</span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="gallery-nav">
                    <div class="gallery-dots" id="galleryDots"></div>
                    <div class="gallery-arrows">
                        <button class="gallery-arrow" id="galleryPrev" aria-label="Previous photo">
                            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M15 6L9 12L15 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
                        </button>
                        <button class="gallery-arrow" id="galleryNext" aria-label="Next photo">
                            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="projects">
            <div class="wrap">
                <div class="section-head reveal">
                    <h2>A sample from the project register</h2>
                    <p class="tag">Replace with your actual project log and site photos when you're ready to publish.</p>
                </div>
                <table class="register reveal">
                    <thead>
                        <tr><th class="reg-no">No.</th><th>Project</th><th>Location</th><th>Type</th><th>Status</th></tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="reg-no mono">GL-24</td>
                            <td class="reg-name">Shreeji Residency</td>
                            <td class="reg-loc">Bopal, Ahmedabad</td>
